# Changelog

All notable changes to the Telegram Auto Filter Bot project will be documented in this file.

## [v3.0.0] - Planned
### Added
- **Group Support:** The bot can now be added to and operated within Telegram groups, allowing members to search and request files directly in the group chat.

## [v2.0.0] - Upcoming
### Added
- **Auto File Delete:** Introduced a feature to automatically delete delivered files or specific bot messages after a set period to keep chats clean and manage storage limitations.

### Fixed
- **Bug Fixes:** General stability improvements, edge-case error handling, and performance optimizations.

## [v1.0.0] - Initial Release
### Added
- **Basic Bot Functionality:** Core search and delivery engine established.
- **Auto-Indexing:** Automatically detects and saves new channel files to the database.
- **MongoDB Integration:** Persistent storage for file metadata and user search queries.
- **Inline Search Results:** Interactive, paginated button interface for seamless file selection.
- **Direct File Delivery:** Uses `copy_message` to securely send files without requiring users to join the database channel.
- **Admin Tools:** Commands for indexing (`/index`), reindexing (`/reindex`), checking stats (`/stats`), and broadcasting (`/broadcast`).
